{"synopsis":"Dunia yang Diliputi Kegelapan\n\nKarena ulah Penyihir Hitam, umat manusia terpaksa mengungsi ke kota raksasa tempat cahaya dan warna berkumpul.\nUntuk merebut kembali dunia, umat manusia terus melakukan ekspedisi, dan seorang anak laki-laki bernama Kei bercita-cita menjadi anggota tim penjelajah itu.\nNamun, ia dikucilkan karena terlahir sebagai “colorless” — seseorang yang tidak memiliki warna.\n\nSuatu hari, akibat sebuah insiden tak terduga, kay memperoleh warna hitam…","alternative_title":"컬러리스트","author":"89line","artist":"89line","chapters":[{"number":"39","chapter":"39","slug":"ca13b051-b67a-4d40-b273-8489b8f192c7","title":"Chapter 39","date":"2026-08-02"},{"number":"38","chapter":"38","slug":"7b49b6af-860f-4321-a50b-bd9cd021fa7c","title":"Chapter 38","date":"2026-07-30"},{"number":"37","chapter":"37","slug":"c6b99704-6c45-4bf0-a0ca-6e918dbc8522","title":"Chapter 37","date":"2026-07-25"},{"number":"36","chapter":"36","slug":"28da26fa-b402-427e-b9fd-ebaa883242ed","title":"Chapter 36","date":"2026-07-21"},{"number":"35","chapter":"35","slug":"51e61ce3-0af3-4dcc-af68-82c64f2021d6","title":"Chapter 35","date":"2026-07-10"},{"number":"34","chapter":"34","slug":"1ace4429-14d9-419c-afcd-dcb707bf1db6","title":"Chapter 34","date":"2026-07-01"},{"number":"33","chapter":"33","slug":"3015a4f4-b7bd-4ee4-87ad-73fb388b0fa6","title":"Chapter 33","date":"2026-06-17"},{"number":"32","chapter":"32","slug":"4563ef7c-5c63-4e0b-babf-a511c41fd59d","title":"Chapter 32","date":"2026-06-10"},{"number":"31","chapter":"31","slug":"69aaf8ad-945d-44e8-b801-f40fb50eecca","title":"Chapter 31","date":"2026-06-08"},{"number":"30","chapter":"30","slug":"b81ead5f-a2e1-48a4-a395-2c89a1f055f4","title":"Chapter 30","date":"2026-06-05"},{"number":"29","chapter":"29","slug":"081ea071-2664-40f2-9f20-3d3291720dd3","title":"Chapter 29","date":"2026-05-08"},{"number":"28","chapter":"28","slug":"44b30946-bbfd-432a-8816-e5e60b04e151","title":"Chapter 28","date":"2026-04-27"},{"number":"27","c